# Alt+j and Alt+k do nothing in Upcoming: the entries keep their order and the file is untouched.
file <<END
- One @due({today+1})
- Two @due({today+1})
- Three @due({today+1})
END
keys gU j
see ▌ - Two
keys <A-j> <A-j> <A-k> k
see ▌ - One
keys j j
see ▌ - Three
quit
saved <<END
- One @due({today+1})
- Two @due({today+1})
- Three @due({today+1})
END
